graph TD
    %% Write Ingestion Flow
    subgraph Ingestion [Ingestion & Write Flow]
        Doc[Document/URL Input] --> Loader[Docling / PyMuPDF Parser]
        Loader --> Splitter[Structural Parent/Child Splitter]
        Splitter --> |Child Chunks| Vectorize[5-Model Ensemble dense/sparse]
        Splitter --> |Entities| GraphExtract[Groq Llama Triplet Extraction]
        Vectorize --> |3,712-D + 32K Sparse| Milvus[(Milvus Lite)]
        GraphExtract --> |Subject-Relation-Object| Neo4j[(Neo4j Graph)]
    end

    %% Read Retrieval Flow
    subgraph Retrieval [Retrieval & Read Flow]
        Query[User Query] --> Expand[Llama 70B Query Expansion & HyDE]
        Expand --> |Dense & Sparse Vector| SearchMilvus[Parallel Milvus Search]
        Expand --> |Entities & Codes| SearchGraph[Neo4j Fact Retrieval]
        SearchMilvus --> RRF[Rank Fusion & X-Algo Boosters]
        SearchGraph --> RRF
        RRF --> Context[Context Aggregator & Parent Expand]
        Context --> Agentic{Agentic Loop Sufficient?}
        Agentic -->|No: Re-Query| Expand
        Agentic -->|Yes| synthesis[Llama Synthesis & Graph Truth Guard]
        synthesis --> Answer[Verified Final Report]
    end

    Milvus -.-> SearchMilvus
    Neo4j -.-> SearchGraph
    synthesis -.-> |Audit check| Neo4j
